== English ==

=== Noun ===

# (transport) A large passenger vehicle optimised for passenger space. 
# (computer) a [[bus]] (on a computer mainboard) is the 'space between' electrical components as a communication path, often conductive. For instance, data travels between the [[CPU]] and the [[RAM]] via the bus. 
# (functional) The movement of awareness and the affect, forming an act at the destination.

